    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Residential are pleased to present this huge opportunity in the beautiful setting of Mullacash. The property comprises a rolling plot of land of 2.11 hectare (c.5.23 acre) zoned 'Agricultural’ under the Kildare County Development Plan 2023 - 2029. There is potential for a ‘local-needs development’ subject to the necessary planning permission. The property is being sold ‘as-is’. There are panoramic views of the local countryside and the Wicklow mountains in the background.\r\n\r\nMullacash is one of the best addresses in the North Kildare area. Local towns include Naas, Kilcullen, Ballymore Eustace and Newbridge. There are many sporting attractions in the area including the racecourses of Punchestown, The Curragh and Naas, golf courses at Craddockstown, Naas and Palmerstown House as well as numerous gyms and leisure centres. There are shops, shopping centres, renowned Michelin Bib Gastro pubs, restaurants, churches, schools and hospitals near-by. The primary schools at Killashee and Two Mile House are only minutes away.\r\n\r\nThe Arrow train service is available from Sallins or Newbridge. The N7 road network will take you to the M50 in twenty minutes.\r\n\r\nNaas 8km, Kilcullen 8km, Ballymore Eustace 7km, Dublin city centre 42km."
      },
